Version 1.0.0:

+ Added a way for account sessions to renew up to 14 days at every 24 hours but on the 13th day it'll then inform the user they will have to manually renew.
+ Added Support for fabric, forge, and neoforge mod loaders...
+ Added discovery to be able to download modpacks from both curseforge / Modrith labeled correctly.
+ Added a My Skins section that'll fetch your current skins for your accounts your logged into, as well as allow you to make new ones with a built in skin painter that is still a WIP.

